OL,3,GNEWSABroadband blackout for thousands
OL,4,Aafter cable theft
OL,5,
OL,6,FCable thieves left thousands in a South
OL,7,FYorkshire village without broadband and
OL,8,Ftelephone connections for two days.
OL,10,FPeople living in Thurnscoe and
OL,11,Fsurrounding areas said elderly
OL,12,Frelatives were left cut off and with no
OL,13,Fother means of contacting their loved
OL,14,Fones due to the disruption on Friday
OL,15,Fand Saturday.
OL,17,FSouth Yorkshire Police said it had
OL,18,Freceived reports of manhole covers on
OL,19,FNicholas Lane in Goldthorpe being
OL,20,Fstolen on Friday morning, with wiring
OL,21,Fdamaged in the area. An investigation
OL,22,Fwas under way, a spokesperson added.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
