OL,3,GNEWSABroadband blackout for thousands
OL,4,Aafter cable theft
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Openreach spokesperson said: "We're
OL,7,Fsorry to everyone who was affected.
OL,8,FCable theft is a serious crime and can
OL,9,Fhave a significant impact on
OL,10,Fcommunities."
